  "summary": {
    "text": "Extracurricular life at IIT Bhubaneswar runs through the Students' Gymkhana, organised into a Technical Council, a Socio-Cultural Council, a Sports Council and an Entrepreneurship Cell, each backing its own set of clubs and societies. Pravaah, a combined sports-technical-cultural fest, now anchors the yearly calendar alongside the sports-focused Ashvamedha, while earlier flagship events such as Alma Fiesta (socio-cultural) and Wissenaire (techno-management) remain part of the institute's fest history. The Student Activity Center hosts courts, a gym and a swimming pool for the campus's day-to-day sporting life at Argul.",
